      "title": "PCNFSD: Improve deobfuscation of identity and password",
      "message": "PCNFSD: Improve deobfuscation of identity and password\n\nIn one case, a trailing null was not being appended but then strlen\nwas used on the result (Coverity CID 1676267.) There were also\nissues around deobfuscating UTF-8 REPLACEMENT CHARACTERS in the case\nof fuzzed data.\n\nIn another case, the function use was not updated for how the\ndeobfuscation no longer works in place after\ncommit 8ed7a73e22c049a2e013bb436e599bff41fc5b9b, with the result\nthat the deobsfucation was not actually doing anything for the password.\n",
